# Built releases. Deliberately NOT in git: each APK is ~15MB (387MB in total here), and every APK built
# before 0.3.33 has the relay bearer token compiled into it — publishing them would leak the credential
# the source no longer carries. Attach APKs to a GitHub Release instead.
releases/
dist/

